  <packageId>TSA.WD.OutpostAfterRaid</packageId>
  <description>This is an addon for the "World Domination" mod. Allows you to directly create an outpost after having defeated a settlement. The outpost will get prepopulated with random pawns having the right skills. The number of pawns dependents on the Tier level of the conquered settlement.</description>
